    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "DRIVER ACKNOWLEDGMENT OF POLICIES",
      "level": 2,
      "style": "SH"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Driver acknowledges that they have received, read, and understood the following key policies:",
      "style": "BT"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet_list",
      "items": [
        "Driver must maintain a valid driver's license and adequate insurance as specified in the Driver Agreement.",
        "Driver must maintain the Vehicle in a safe and clean condition, with all safety equipment functional.",
        "Driver must complete a vehicle inspection before commencing operations and periodically thereafter.",
        "Driver must comply with all traffic laws and drive safely and responsibly at all times.",
        "Driver must not engage in any violent, threatening, or harassing behavior toward passengers, other drivers, or Platform personnel.",
        "Driver must not discriminate against passengers on the basis of race, color, religion, national origin, sex, disability, or any other protected characteristic.",
        "Driver must not use alcohol or drugs while operating the Vehicle or while on a trip.",
        "Driver must not operate the Vehicle if they feel unwell, fatigued, or otherwise impaired.",
        "Driver must report any accidents, incidents, or safety concerns to Platform immediately or within {{incident_report_hours}} hours.",
        "Driver must not charge passengers any amount beyond the fare calculated by the Platform.",
        "Driver must comply with all local laws, regulations, and permit requirements applicable to ride-share operations.",
        "Driver understands that Platform may deactivate Driver's account for violations of these policies.",
        "{{onboarding_ack_items_extra}}"
      ]
    },
